<title>USA: Lam Research names Johnson as new CFO.</title>
<headline>Lam Research names Johnson as new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lam Research Corp said it has named Mercedes Johnson as its new chief financial officer, replacing Henk Evenhuis who announced his planned retirement last year.</p>
<p>Johnson was previously vice president and worldwide operations controller at Applied Materials Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;Ms. Johnson has significant experience in building and managing a solid, international financial operation that supports a multi-billion enterprise,&quot; Roger Emerick, chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
